n>新的研究，&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 19:00:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/nanoparticles-repair-mitochondria-to-boost-bone-regeneration-in-diabetic-rats</guid></item><item><title>科学家发现类星体在大爆炸后6.3亿年形成</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/scientists-discover-quasar-formed-630-million-years-after-the-big-bang</link><description>新发现的天体正式名称为 J1504+6252，昵称是 Dún Aonghas。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 18:45:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/scientists-discover-quasar-formed-630-million-years-after-the-big-bang</guid></item><item><title>天文学家发现一颗死亡恒星每 8 分钟旋转一次并发送神秘的射电脉冲</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/astronomers-discover-a-dead-star-spinning-every-8-minutes-and-sending-mysterious-radio-pulses</link><description>科学家们在5000多光年之外发现了一对奇怪的恒星对，其中一颗死亡恒星每八分钟旋转一次，在绕着一颗类太阳恒星运行时会产生神秘的射电脉冲。这一突破还揭示了伴星上存在的巨大磁暴，为天文学新出现的谜团之一提供了新的线索。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 18:30:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/11/astronomers-discover-a-dead-star-spinning-every-8-minutes-and-sending-mysterious-radio-pulses</guid></item></channel></rss>